// AFECON -> Configurações gerais //
  .DACREFEN:  High speed DAC reference enable. 
  .SINC2EN :  ADC output 50 Hz/60 Hz notch filter enable. This bit enables the 50 Hz/60 Hz supply rejection filter.
  .DFTEN:     DFT hardware accelerator enable. This bit enables the DFT hardware acceleration block. 
  .WAVEGENEN: Waveform generator enable. This bit enables the waveform generator
  .TIAEN:     High speed TIA enable. This bit enables the high speed TIA. 
  .INAMPEN:   Excitation instrumentation amplifier enable. This bit enables the instrumentation amplifier. 
  .EXBUFEN:   Excitation buffer enable. This bit enables the excitation buffer to drive the resistance being measured.
  .ADCCONVEN: ADC conversion start enable
  .ADCEN:     ADC power enable. This bit enables the ADC. 
  .DACEN:     High speed DAC enable. This bit enables the high speed DAC, the corresponding reconstruction 
                filter, and the attenuator. This bit only enables the analog block and does not include the DAC waveform generator.
  .HSREFDIS:  High speed reference disable. This bit is the power-down signal of the high power reference. Set this bit to 1 to power down the reference.

// PMBW -> Power Mode Configuration Register //
  .SYSBW: System bandwidth configure. The reconstruction filter of the high speed DAC and the antialias filter bandwidth configuration of the ADC are configured by a single register.
  .SYSHS: Sets the high speed DAC and ADC in high power mode

